{"unit_id":"tag:0G7B:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complexes）的短正合列（short exact sequence），使得 <MATH_0003> 的各项（terms）为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）。若 <MATH_0005> 中的三个有两个 K-平坦（K-flat），则第三个也是。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"正合列对象"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"复形短正合列"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"各项的平坦性"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"正合列中的性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7B:proof","translation":"由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001>，对每个复形（complex）<MATH_0001>，得到短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0002>\n其对象为复形（complexes）。因此，由上同调层（cohomology sheaves）的长正合列（exact sequence）及 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complexes）的定义，得到本引理。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"张量因子"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"张量后的序列"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"序列对象"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"复形上同调层"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列","context":"上同调长正合列"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"复形性质"}],"notes":[]}
