{"unit_id":"tag:06YQ:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为上有界（bounded above）的复形（complex），由平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0002>-模（modules）组成。设 <MATH_0003> 为无上同调（acyclic）的复形（complex），由 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成。注意\n<MATH_0005>\n其中逐项（termwise）取余极限（colimits）。因而逐项（termwise）也有\n<MATH_0006>\n因此，为证明左侧复形（complex）无上同调（acyclic），只需证明右侧每个复形（complexes）均无上同调（acyclic）。由于 <MATH_0007> 无上同调（acyclic），这将问题归结为 <MATH_0008> 上有界（bounded above）的情形。在此情形下，《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0001> 的谱序列（spectral sequence）具有\n<MATH_0009>\n它为零，因为 <MATH_0010> 平坦（flat），且 <MATH_0011> 无上同调（acyclic）。因此得证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界","context":"复形有界性"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"张量因子"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"各项平坦性"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调","context":"复形上同调消失"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项","context":"复形逐项运算"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"截断复形的余极限"},{"sour