{"unit_id":"tag:077J:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。对任意复形（complex）<MATH_0002>（由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成），存在由 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）组成的复形（complexes）的交换图式（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0005>\n具有以下性质：(1) 竖直箭头（arrows）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms），且逐项（termwise）满射（surjective），(2) 每个 <MATH_0006> 均为上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），其各项（terms）为直和（direct sums），由 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）组成，它们形如 <MATH_0008>，以及 (3) 映射（maps）<MATH_0009> 逐项（termwise）为分裂单射（split injections），其余核（cokernels）为直和（direct sums），由 <MATH_0010>-模（modules）组成，它们形如 <MATH_0011>。此外，映射（map）<MATH_0012> 为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"split injections","target_term":"分裂单射"},{"source_term":"cokernels","target_term":"余核"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"给定及上有界复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形",