{"unit_id":"tag:077J:proof","translation":"图式（diagram）的存在及性质 (1)、(2)、(3) 直接来自《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001> 及《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0002>。诱导映射（induced map）\n<MATH_0001>\n为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），因为滤过余极限（filtered colimits）正合（exact）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"filtered colimits","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式","context":"构造图式"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射","context":"余极限上的映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"诱导映射性质"},{"source_term":"filtered colimits","target_term":"滤过余极限","context":"复形余极限"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"余极限正合性"}],"notes":[]}
